  Key = the English text itself. Format: "English key" = "Translation";
  Placeholders %@ / %d / %lld; positional %1$@ / %2$@ when German needs another order.
  Every key must exist in en.lproj and de.lproj. Check: python3 scripts/check-strings.py
  Convention: docs/development.md, section "Localization".
*/
